+** forces a serial reduction dependency (acc = acc + x) that blocks
+** vectorization; four independent ones let the compiler pack the four
+** multiply-adds into one vector FMA and only reduce to a scalar once, at the
+** end of each block. This is the standard idiom for coaxing SLP/loop
